<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent liftings rise, half to U.S..</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent liftings rise, half to U.S..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent blend loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal rose to 819,555 tonnes in the week to January 15 from 523,756 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Almost 54 percent of the oil, 439,519 tonnes, was destined for refineries in North America. The previous week 43 percent or 226,109 tonnes went transatlantic.</p>
